---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="AGAPE — Bijbel, gebed en traditie">
  <header class="sticky top-4 z-40 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <nav class="bg-paper/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full px-5 py-3 flex items-center justify-between border border-line shadow-soft">
      <a href="#top" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-paper text-lg bg-bordeaux">✝</span>
        <span class="font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight">AGAPE</span>
      </a>
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-7 text-sm font-medium text-muted">
        <a href="#features" class="hover:text-ink transition">In de app</a>
        <a href="#tradities" class="hover:text-ink transition">Tradities</a>
        <a href="#download" class="hover:text-ink transition">Download</a>
      </div>
      <a href="#download" class="bg-bordeaux text-paper px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold">Download</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main id="top" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5">
    <section class="pt-16 pb-24 md:pt-24 md:pb-28">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-14 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 text-center lg:text-left">
          <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-bordeaux uppercase mb-5"><span class="h-px w-8 bg-gold"></span>Bijbel · gebed · traditie</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">Lees de Bijbel<span class="mt-1 block font-serif italic font-medium text-bordeaux text-[0.92em]">met de stem van de Kerk.</span></h1>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted max-w-md mx-auto lg:mx-0">AGAPE houdt Schrift, gebed en heiligen bij elkaar. Een rustige lezer voor wie de traditie niet losstaat van de tekst.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center lg:justify-start">
            <a href="#download" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bordeaux text-paper px-6 font-semibold">Download voor Android</a>
            <a href="#features" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line bg-paper px-6 font-semibold">Wat zit erin</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-full max-w-[300px] bg-ink rounded-phone p-2.5 shadow-soft">
            <div class="bg-parchment rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden p-5">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-bordeaux uppercase">Johannes 3</p>
              <h2 class="font-serif italic text-2xl mt-1">Vers 16</h2>
              <p class="font-serif text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">Want alzo lief heeft God de wereld gehad, dat Hij Zijn eniggeboren Zoon gegeven heeft…</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-4">Statenvertaling</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="features" class="py-20">
      <h2 class="font-serif italic text-3xl text-center mb-10">Rustig lezen. Dieper blijven.</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <article class="bg-paper border border-line rounded-card p-7"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl">Bijbellezer</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted mt-2">Grote letters en kruisverwijzingen zonder afleiding.</p></article>
        <article class="bg-paper border border-line rounded-card p-7"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl">Gebed & Heiligen</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted mt-2">Agpeya, Horologion en de heilige van de dag naast de tekst.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="tradities" class="pb-20">
      <div class="bg-paper border border-line rounded-card p-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif italic text-3xl">Drie families, dezelfde Bijbel.</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm text-muted">
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base">Oosters-orthodox</h3><p class="mt-1">Zeven oecumenische synoden en de vaders.</p></div>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base">Oriëntaals-orthodox</h3><p class="mt-1">Koptisch, Syrisch, Armeens, Ethiopisch.</p></div>
          <div><h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base">Katholiek</h3><p class="mt-1">Schrift en heilige traditie samen.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="download" class="pb-16">
      <div class="bg-bordeaux text-paper rounded-card p-10">
        <h2 class="font-serif italic text-3xl">Begin vandaag met lezen.</h2>
        <a href="https://github.com/gabriel360110l/AGAPE-Android3" class="mt-6 inline-flex bg-paper text-ink px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold">Naar de Android-app</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="border-t border-line py-8 text-sm text-muted"><p class="font-semibold text-ink">AGAPE</p></footer>
</Layout>
